{"overview":"جورج هاردی، چوپان مهربان، هر شب رمان‌های کارآگاهی برای گله گوسفندانش می‌خواند و فکر می‌کند آنها چیزی متوجه نمی‌شوند. اما وقتی جورج به شکل مرموزی کشته می‌شود، گوسفندان که تا آن لحظه مرگ را فقط در داستان‌ها می‌شناختند، تصمیم می‌گیرند خودشان کارآگاه شوند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"George Hardy is a shepherd who reads detective novels to his beloved sheep every night, assuming they can't possibly understand. But when a mysterious incident disrupts life on the farm, the sheep realize they must become the detectives. As they follow the clues and investigate human suspects, they prove that even sheep can be brilliant crime-solvers.","tagline_en":"A new breed of mystery.","runtime":109,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["Kyle Balda"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["US","GB"],"cast":[{"name":"هیو جکمن","role":"George Hardy","photo":"/4Xujtewxqt6aU0Y81tsS9gkjizk.jpg","en":"Hugh Jackman"},{"name":"نیکولاس براون","role":"Officer Tim Derry","photo":"/b2I6bZptuld3pjlVkYIy4DtMKGg.jpg","en":"Nicholas Braun"},{"name":"نیکلاس گالیتزین","role":"Elliot Matthews","photo":"/hG4rH7eBMs117746bBOd8fUa4PA.jpg","en":"Nicholas Galitzine"},{"name":"مالی گوردن","role":"Rebecca Hampstead","photo":"/5sMIadZ0CIL7IUCJHnqO4ZFsdEM.jpg","en":"Molly Gordon"},{"name":"جولیا لوئیس-دریفوس","role":"Lily (voice)","photo":"/iEfHQNrVbVFesDPjdySom9nqsFg.jpg","en":"Julia Louis-Dreyfus"},{"name":"برایان کرانستون","role":"Sebastian (voice)","photo":"/7Jahy5LZX2Fo8fGJltMreAI49hC.jpg","en":"Bryan Cranston"},{"name":"کریس اودوود","role":"Mopple (voice)","photo":"/xhfgliN8DInDVBliPq7JDeKNCvz.jpg","en":"Chris O'Dowd"},{"name":"رجینا هال","role":"Cloud (voice)","photo":"/jiFZ4xNrvUUZLBHnJu71CvdN4kj.jpg","en":"Regina Hall"},{"name":"پاتریک استوارت","role":"Sir Ritchfield (voice)","photo":"/ufqtnLh3JJjPbEgxEag3MM5nZyv.jpg","en":"Patrick Stewart"},{"name":"بلا رمزی","role":"Zora (voice)","photo":"/vDbgxc7RYawpB1wK7JDEj62j06H.jpg","en":"Bella Ramsey"},{"name":"ریس داربی","role":"Wool-Eyes (v